  "details": "# Issue:\n\nWhen looking at the Group Activity in the Social Tab you will see an indicator for how many Groups currently have instances open. This is visible as a small number on the Groups Activity Category button, as well as in the Title / Header of it.\n\nThis is however not the case with the Group Activity in the Groups Tab, here there is no such indicator, neither on the Groups Activity button or the Title / Header.\n\n# Expected Behavior:\n\nThe Group Activity should show the indicator in both the Social and Groups Tab, as it makes it easier to just quickly see if any event etc is going on.\n\n# Attachments:\n\nThe first picture shows the Groups Activity in the Social Tab and the second one in the Groups Tab:",
